  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&apos;s help lonely elderly living in Hungary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As hard as it is to accept, we all grow old!  Hungary is also one of the aging societies. The number of elderly people living alone and isolated is increasing.    The Friends of the Elderly Program of the Voluntary Center Foundation aimed to reduce the number by organising more volunteers who visit the seniors, who help in their daily problems, trying to eliminate their loneliness and solitude.  With your help we can increase the elderly/volunteer groups in Budapest from 5 to 15 this year!</narrative>
  </description>
